variables: []
role: capture.write-agentic
response_format: text
---

Write the wiki page. Call list_sources() to see what is available, read the
sources you need with read_source(stem, offset=0) — a source longer than one
window ends its reply with the next offset, so keep reading until you have
the text you need — then submit the finished Markdown with save_page(content).
